HST Office: Writer ribbon content for 1.0.0, closer to the Office ribbon.

Commands that Writer can run are added on the tab and group where an Office user looks for them (Paste Special,
Change Case, Sort, Borders, Select, Drop Cap, Signature Line, Date & Time, arrange commands on Layout, the mail
merge groups Create, Write & Insert Fields and Preview Results, Accessibility, proofing language, Show Comments,
Macros on View, table, picture and shape commands on their contextual tabs). Groups get a launcher at the right
end of the caption row that opens the full dialog of the group (Font, Paragraph, Styles, Page Setup, Footnotes,
table, picture and shape groups). Format Painter and Clear Formatting show their labels. A new Help tab ("Trợ giúp")
sits before "Phần mở rộng"; the Developer tab is merged into "Phần mở rộng" (macros, extensions and options,
content controls, protection, templates), and its tab menu joins the "Phần mở rộng" tab menu. KeyTip letters for
the Help tab and the new commands.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
